        "accession_number": "0000014272-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, we manufacture for clinical and commercial use several sterile products, biologics and CAR-T cell therapy products, all of which are particularly complex and involve highly specialized manufacturing technologies.",
        "start_character": 84630,
        "end_character": 84855
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000014272-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000014272-26-000004-9a8a28cc437f4ea2",
        "accession_number": "0000014272-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For our cell therapy product candidates and marketed products, including Breyanzi and Abecma, we have invested in our own manufacturing network, including facilities in Bothell, Washington;",
        "start_character": 83639,
        "end_character": 83828
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000014272-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000014272-26-000004-9a8a28cc437f4ea2",
        "accession_number": "0000014272-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Given that shifting or adding manufacturing capacity can be a lengthy process requiring significant capital and other expenditures as well as regulatory approvals, we manage and operate a flexible manufacturing network that minimizes unnecessary product transfers and inefficient uses of manufacturing capacity.",
        "start_character": 82682,
        "end_character": 82993
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000014272-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000014272-26-000004-9a8a28cc437f4ea2",
        "accession_number": "0000014272-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our own manufacturing sites, we rely on third parties to manufacture or supply us with all or a portion of the active product ingredient or drug substance necessary for us to manufacture various products, including Eliquis, Opdivo, Pomalyst/Imnovid, Yervoy, Sprycel, Abraxane, Zeposia, Camzyos, Sotyktu, Krazati and Cobenfy.",
        "start_character": 85283,
        "end_character": 85622
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000014272-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000014272-26-000004-9a8a28cc437f4ea2",
        "accession_number": "0000014272-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, in support of a continued investment in our cell therapy portfolio, we continue expanding our manufacturing capabilities through the construction of new state-of-the-art cell therapy manufacturing facilities in Devens, Massachusetts, which was completed in 2023 and in Leiden, Netherlands, which was completed in 2025.",
        "start_character": 36672,
        "end_character": 37003
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000014272-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000014272-26-000004-9a8a28cc437f4ea2",
        "accession_number": "0000014272-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In order to support supply continuity, we continue to partner with third party manufacturers to expand supply of vector and are investing in new facilities for drug product manufacturing.",
        "start_character": 84977,
        "end_character": 85164
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000014272-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000014272-26-000004-9a8a28cc437f4ea2",
        "accession_number": "0000014272-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our marketing and sales of prescription pharmaceuticals is limited to the approved uses of the particular product, but we continue to develop scientific data and other information about potential additional uses of our products and provide such information as scientific exchange at scientific congresses or we share information about our products in other appropriate ways, including the development of publications, or in response to unsolicited inquiries from doctors, other medical professionals and MCOs.",
        "start_character": 50300,
        "end_character": 50809
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000014272-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000014272-26-000004-9a8a28cc437f4ea2",
        "accession_number": "0000014272-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also sell our pharmaceutical products in other countries;",
        "start_character": 23839,
        "end_character": 23899
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000014272-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000014272-26-000004-9a8a28cc437f4ea2",
        "accession_number": "0000014272-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We anticipate that the laws and regulations affecting the manufacture and sale of current products and the introduction of new products will continue to require substantial scientific and technical effort, time and expense as well as significant capital investments.",
        "start_character": 65985,
        "end_character": 66251
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000014272-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000014272-26-000004-9a8a28cc437f4ea2",
        "accession_number": "0000014272-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also expanding our use of third-party manufacturers for drug product and finished goods manufacturing and we continue to shift towards using third-party manufacturers for supply of our mature and other brands.",
        "start_character": 85623,
        "end_character": 85839
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000014272-26-000004",
